 put</span><span begin="00:12.040" end="00:12.120"> my</span><span begin="00:12.230" end="00:13.120"> heart</span><span begin="00:13.150" end="00:13.260"> in</span><span begin="00:13.340" end="00:13.510"> the</span><span begin="00:13.540" end="00:13.940"> bag</span><span begin="00:13.990" end="00:14.160"> (in</span><span begin="00:14.270" end="00:14.470"> the</span><span begin="00:14.510" end="00:15.010"> bag)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.920" end="00:17.380"><span begin="00:14.920" end="00:14.970">And</span><span begin="00:14.980" end="00:15.190"> nobody</span><span begin="00:15.240" end="00:15.380"> gets</span><span begin="00:15.390" end="00:15.510"> hurt</span><span begin="00:15.640" end="00:15.860"> (don't</span><span begin="00:15.900" end="00:16.200"> hurt</span><span begin="00:16.240" end="00:16.320"> me,</span><span begin="00:16.350" end="00:17.380"> love)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.380" end="00:20.910"><span begin="00:17.380" end="00:17.460">Now</span><span begin="00:17.470" end="00:17.530"> I'm</span><span begin="00:17.560" end="00:17.930"> runnin'</span><span begin="00:17.970" end="00:18.140"> from</span><span begin="00:18.150" end="00:18.230"> her</span><span begin="00:18.300" end="00:18.670"> love,</span><span begin="00:18.710" end="00:18.800"> I'm</span><span begin="00:18.810" end="00:18.880"> not</span><span begin="00:18.920" end="00:19.070"> fast</span><span begin="00:19.100" end="00:20.600"> (fast)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.910" end="00:23.450"><span begin="00:20.910" end="00:20.940">So</span><span begin="00:20.960" end="00:21.070"> I'm</span><span begin="00:21.100" end="00:21.290"> makin'</span><span begin="00:21.400" end="00:21.470"> it</span><span begin="00:21.500" end="00:21.730"> worse</span><span begin="00:21.800" end="00:21.960"> (I'm</span><span begin="00:22.030" end="00:22.270"> makin'</span><span begin="00:22.290" end="00:22.330"> it</span><span begin="00:22.360" end="00:23.450"> worse)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.450" end="00:27.080"><span begin="00:23.450" end="00:23.500">Now</span><span begin="00:23.520" end="00:23.640"> I'm</span><span begin="00:23.680" end="00:23.990"> diggin'</span><span begin="00:24.070" end="00:24.140"> up</span><span begin="00:24.190" end="00:24.210"> a</span><span begin="00:24.260" end="00:24.650"> grave</span><span begin="00:24.690" end="00:24.910"> for</span><span begin="00:25.070" end="00:25.330"> my</span><span begin="00:25.370" end="00:26.870"> past</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.080" end="00:29.930"><span begin="00:27.080" end="00:27.100">I'm</span><span begin="00:27.110" end="00:27.190"> a</span><span begin="00:27.210" end="00:27.530"> whole</span><span begin="00:27.550" end="00:27.910"> different</span><span begin="00:28.000" end="00:29.440"> person</span><span begin="00:29.470" end="00:29.590"> (I'm</span><span begin="00:29.620" end="00:29.640"> a</span><span begin="00:29.660" end="00:29.740"> whole</span><span begin="00:29.750" end="00:29.830"> different</span><span begin="00:29.830" end="00:30.330"> person)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.930" end="00:32.490"><span begin="00:29.930" end="00:30.010">It's</span><span begin="00:30.040" end="00:30.050"> a</span><span begin="00:30.070" end="00:30.260"> gift</span><span begin="00:30.290" end="00:30.430"> and</span><span begin="00:30.510" end="00:30.570"> a</span><span begin="00:30.610" end="00:31.150"> curse</span><span begin="00:31.180" end="00:31.430"> (it's</span><span begin="00:31.460" end="00:31.480"> a</span><span begin="00:31.500" end="00:31.560"> gift</span><span begin="00:31.570" end="00:31.610"> and</span><span begin="00:31.630" end="00:31.650"> a</span><span begin="00:31.660" end="00:32.490"> curse)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.490" end="00:36.460"><span begin="00:32.490" end="00:32.660">But</span><span begin="00:32.710" end="00:32.800"> I</span><span begin="00:32.860" end="00:33.240"> cannot</span><span begin="00:33.330" end="00:33.900"> reverse</span><span begin="00:34.030" end="00:35.530"> it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.460" end="00:41.860"><span begin="00:36.460" end="00:36.480">I</span><span begin="00:36.510" end="00:36.730"> can't</span><span begin="00:36.790" end="00:37.360"> reverse</span><span begin="00:37.670" end="00:38.130"> it,</span><span begin="00:38.980" end="00:39.570"> it</span><span begin="00:39.670" end="00:40.020"> was</span><span begin="00:40.090" end="00:40.140"> a</span><span begin="00:40.210" end="00:40.460"> gift</span><span begin="00:40.500" end="00:40.670"> and</span><span begin="00:40.710" end="00:40.740"> a</span><span begin="00:40.790" end="00:41.860"> curse</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.860" end="00:44.900"><span begin="00:41.860" end="00:41.940">And</span><span begin="00:41.970" end="00:42.050"> now,</span><span begin="00:42.090" end="00:42.190"> I'm</span><span begin="00:42.250" end="00:42.530"> drinkin'</span><span begin="00:42.570" end="00:42.700"> too</span><span begin="00:42.820" end="00:43.080"> much,</span><span begin="00:43.120" end="00:43.180"> so</span><span begin="00:43.280" end="00:43.480"> I'ma</span><span begin="00:43.520" end="00:43.640"> talk</span><span begin="00:43.700" end="00:43.810"> with</span><span begin="00:43.860" end="00:43.900"> a</span><span begin="00:43.960" end="00:44.900"> slur</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.900" end="00:49.780"><span begin="00:44.900" end="00:44.980">Last</span><span begin="00:45.010" end="00:45.300"> time</span><span begin="00:45.330" end="00:45.350"> I</span><span begin="00:45.410" end="00:45.590"> saw</span><span begin="00:45.690" end="00:46.210"> you,</span><span begin="00:46.290" end="00:46.400"> it</span><span begin="00:46.490" end="00:47.270"> ended</span><span begin="00:47.440" end="00:47.610"> in</span><span begin="00:47.700" end="00:47.750"> a</span><span begin="00:47.840" end="00:49.340"> blur</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.780" end="00:54.770"><span b