"> fur,</span><span begin="01:03.090" end="01:03.450"> and</span><span begin="01:03.520" end="01:03.790"> I</span><span begin="01:03.880" end="01:04.040"> put</span><span begin="01:04.110" end="01:04.230"> my</span><span begin="01:04.280" end="01:04.490"> wrist</span><span begin="01:04.550" end="01:04.680"> on</span><span begin="01:04.750" end="01:06.250"> iceberg</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.600" end="01:09.520"><span begin="01:06.600" end="01:06.730">One</span><span begin="01:06.750" end="01:07.030"> thing</span><span begin="01:07.100" end="01:07.270"> my</span><span begin="01:07.370" end="01:07.720"> heart</span><span begin="01:07.830" end="01:08.110"> tells</span><span begin="01:08.190" end="01:08.310"> me</span><span begin="01:08.380" end="01:09.520"> is</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.520" end="01:11.990"><span begin="01:09.520" end="01:09.570">"</span><span begin="01:09.570" end="01:09.630"> Flex</span><span begin="01:09.660" end="01:09.810"> on</span><span begin="01:09.870" end="01:09.910"> a</span><span begin="01:09.980" end="01:10.150"> ho</span><span begin="01:10.240" end="01:10.430"> every</span><span begin="01:10.490" end="01:10.670"> time</span><span begin="01:10.730" end="01:11.100"> you're</span><span begin="01:11.160" end="01:11.990"> insecure"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.990" end="01:17.260"><span begin="01:11.990" end="01:12.250">I</span><span begin="01:12.310" end="01:12.790"> can't</span><span begin="01:12.830" end="01:12.940"> see</span><span begin="01:12.990" end="01:13.050"> it</span><span begin="01:13.090" end="01:13.880"> through,</span><span begin="01:13.930" end="01:14.180"> I'm</span><span begin="01:14.240" end="01:14.580"> runnin'</span><span begin="01:14.640" end="01:14.900"> from</span><span begin="01:14.940" end="01:16.440"> you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.260" end="01:20.120"><span begin="01:17.260" end="01:17.300">Is</span><span begin="01:17.350" end="01:17.480"> your</span><span begin